# Univer's insider registry is publicly readable; no account or token is needed.
# It mirrors every Univer release on npmjs.org (tarballs redirect there) and also
# carries insider builds, so these scopes can resolve an SDK version before it is
# public.
@univer-cli:registry=https://insider-npm-registry.univer.work/
@univerjs:registry=https://insider-npm-registry.univer.work/
@univerjs-pro:registry=https://insider-npm-registry.univer.work/
